  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Mobs/BH_Realistic_Mobs_header.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></strong></span></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">这个资源包改变了《我的世界》中许多原版生物的外观！目前，它主要改变了以下生物的外观（虽然还有更多纹理正在制作中）：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 僵尸</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 骷髅</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 苦力怕</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 蜘蛛</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 僵尸猪灵</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 洞穴蜘蛛</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 尸壳</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 疣猪兽</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 烈焰人</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a> 模组支持（也兼容 OptiFine）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">纹理和模型的设计者是 AviArt。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要服务器和朋友一起游玩吗？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Mobs/BH_Realistic_Mobs_promo2.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"251\"></span></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果您正在寻找与朋友一起玩模组或整合包的服务器，<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong></span> 是您的最佳选择！他们提供性价比最高的《我的世界》服务器，并且如果您点击<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此链接</a></strong></span>并使用优惠码“Lupin”，即可享受 25% 的折扣。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Mobs/BH_Realistic_Mobs_summary.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"149\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">该资源包改变了社区中最受喜爱的部分原版生物的外观，当然，现在它们看起来更加逼真且有趣！但请放心，它们依然会以兼容原版的方式呈现，同时在一定程度上保留与默认纹理的相似性。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Mobs/BH_Realistic_Mobs_faq.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"148\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>它在服务器上能正常工作吗？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">当然可以！它能完美运行！请记住，使用模组和朋友一起游玩的最佳方式是选择 BisectHosting，并且通过<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此链接即可获得 25% 的折扣</a></strong>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>此资源包能否用于整合包中？</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">当然可以！只要仅发布在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 上即可。将其上传至任何其他平台都将被视为侵犯我们的权益，是严格禁止的。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">不过，如果您考虑将其加入您的 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 整合包中，我们将不胜感激。如果您需要任何小修改或有疑问，请联系我们！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Mobs/BH_Realistic_Mobs_screenshots.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"149\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/606/realistic-mobs.png\" width=\"1707\" height=\"960\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1020/636/realistic-mobs-55.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1707\" height=\"913\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1071/435/realistic-mobs.jpg\" width=\"1707\" height=\"960\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1071/437/realistic-mobs-3.jpg\" width=\"1707\" height=\"960\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></span></a></span></p>",
